# Ember -- firelight, and not much of it
#
# Warm the whole way through: hues rotated towards orange, the cool
# families allowed to stay cool but dimmed, so blues sit back in the dark
# and anything red comes forward. Reads like a room lit by one fire.

name    Ember
blurb   Banked coals. Everything is a little too warm.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
